[0.000, "o", "## Review\r\n\r\nOne-line change: adds `asciinema-record = true` to `[flags]` in `.repo.toml`.\r\n\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Correctness:** The flag is already read by `.just/repo-toml.just` and `.just/cue-verify.just`, and `.just/gh-process.just` uses it. The key name and boolean type match what those scripts expect. It sits in the existing `[flags]` block, in the same style as the other flags.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Failure modes:** If `asciinema` isn't on PATH, `gh-process.just` prints a warning and runs unrecorded. `cue-verify` only soft-warns. CI runners without asciinema shouldn't break.\r\n- **Security:** Recordings go to `.cache/`. Check that `.cache/` is gitignored so `.cast` files, which can capture terminal output and tokens, aren't committed by accident. I didn't verify this.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "- **Tests:** None needed, since this is config only.\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\n"]
